<title>UK: S&amp;P says Russia long-term ratings outlook stable.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says Russia long-term ratings outlook stable.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said in a statement on Monday its outlook on the long-term sovereign rating for Russia, assigned at BB minus, was stable.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6784</p>
